{"no":12,"title":"Goodbye and Good Luck","titleZh":"再见，一路顺风","audio":"L12.mp3","duration":76.6,"question":{"en":"Where is Captain Alison going and how?","zh":"艾利森船长要去哪儿，怎么去？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":13.01,"t2":19.94,"en":"Where is Captain Alison going and how?","zh":"艾利森船长要去哪儿，怎么去？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":19.94,"t2":27.59,"en":"Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow.","zh":"我们的邻居查尔斯·艾利森船长明天就要从朴次茅斯启航了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will sail tomorrow","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"from Portsmouth","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"Captain Charles Alison","g":"名词作定语/专名"},{"c":"NP","x":"Our neighbour","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓句型"]},{"i":2,"t":27.59,"t2":32.05,"en":"We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning.","zh":"明天一大早我们将在码头为他送行。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"'ll meet him early","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at the harbour","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in the morning","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the harbour","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":3,"t":32.05,"t2":36.75,"en":"He will be in his small boat, Topsail.","zh":"他将乘坐他的“涛波赛”号小艇。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will be","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in his small boat Topsail","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"his small boat","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓句型"]},{"i":4,"t":36.75,"t2":40.27,"en":"Topsail is a famous little boat.","zh":"“涛波赛”号是艘有名的小艇。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is boat","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a famous little boat","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":5,"t":40.27,"t2":45.7,"en":"It has sailed across the Atlantic many times.","zh":"它已经多次横渡大西洋。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"has sailed times","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"across the Atlantic","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the Atlantic","g":"名词作定语/专名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["现在完成时","主谓句型"]},{"i":6,"t":45.7,"t2":50.17,"en":"Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock,","zh":"艾利森船长将于8点钟启航，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will set out","g":"短语动词"},{"c":"PP","x":"at eight o'clock","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"Captain Alison","g":"名词作定语/专名"},{"c":"NP","x":"eight o'clock","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓句型"]},{"i":7,"t":50.17,"t2":53.35,"en":"so we'll have plenty of time.","zh":"因此我们有充裕的时间。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"so 'll have plenty","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of time","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":8,"t":53.35,"t2":58.04,"en":"We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him.","zh":"我们将参观他的船，然后和他告别。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"then 'll say goodbye","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"VP","x":"'ll see boat","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to him","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"his boat","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":9,"t":58.04,"t2":61.04,"en":"He will be away for two months.","zh":"他要离开两个月。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will be away","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for two months","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"two months","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":10,"t":61.04,"t2":63.82,"en":"We are very proud of him.","zh":"我们真为他感到自豪。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"are proud","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of him","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very proud of him","g":"形容词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":11,"t":63.82,"t2":73.82,"en":"He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic.","zh":"他将参加一次重大的横渡大西洋的比赛。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"will take part","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in an important race across the Atlantic","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"across the Atlantic","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"an important race","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]}]}